§ `Tests: reg 3(1), terms defined here`

-- "appropriate body" means any body which regulates or is representative of ...: either limb suffices.
#ASSERT `reg 3(1) the body is an appropriate body` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 3(1) the body is an appropriate body` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 3(1) the body is an appropriate body` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 3(1) the body is an appropriate body` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- "authorised person" means a person who is authorised for the purposes of FSMA.
#ASSERT `reg 3(1) the person is an authorised person` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 3(1) the person is an authorised person` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- "authorised cryptoasset firm" means an authorised person who is authorised to carry on a regulated activity specified by Chapter 2B: both limbs.
#ASSERT `reg 3(1) the person is an authorised cryptoasset firm` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 3(1) the person is an authorised cryptoasset firm` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 3(1) the person is an authorised cryptoasset firm` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 3(1) the person is an authorised cryptoasset firm` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- "beneficial owner": body corporate or partnership, reg 5; trust or similar, or estate, reg 6; any other case, reg 6(9).
#ASSERT `reg 3(1) beneficial owner is given by` `a company` EQUALS LIST "regulation 5"
#ASSERT `reg 3(1) beneficial owner is given by` `a limited liability partnership` EQUALS LIST "regulation 5"
#ASSERT `reg 3(1) beneficial owner is given by` `a body corporate of another kind` EQUALS LIST "regulation 5"
#ASSERT `reg 3(1) beneficial owner is given by` `a partnership other than a limited liability partnership` EQUALS LIST "regulation 5"
#ASSERT `reg 3(1) beneficial owner is given by` `a trust` EQUALS LIST "regulation 6"
#ASSERT `reg 3(1) beneficial owner is given by` `a foundation or other legal arrangement similar to a trust` EQUALS LIST "regulation 6"
#ASSERT `reg 3(1) beneficial owner is given by` `the estate of a deceased person in the course of administration` EQUALS LIST "regulation 6"
#ASSERT `reg 3(1) beneficial owner is given by` `an individual` EQUALS LIST "regulation 6(9)"
#ASSERT `reg 3(1) beneficial owner is given by` `a corporation sole` EQUALS LIST "regulation 6(9)"
#ASSERT `reg 3(1) beneficial owner is given by` `an unincorporated association` EQUALS LIST "regulation 6(9)"
#ASSERT `reg 3(1) beneficial owner is given by` `another legal entity or legal arrangement` EQUALS LIST "regulation 6(9)"

