-- "occasional transaction" means a transaction which is not carried out as part of a business relationship.
`reg 3(1) test case: a transaction outside a business relationship` MEANS Transaction WITH
    `value in sterling, linked operations taken together` IS 500
    `paid in cash` IS FALSE
    `carried out as part of a business relationship` IS FALSE
    `a transfer of funds under the funds transfer regulation` IS FALSE
`reg 3(1) test case: a transaction within a business relationship` MEANS Transaction WITH
    `value in sterling, linked operations taken together` IS 500
    `paid in cash` IS FALSE
    `carried out as part of a business relationship` IS TRUE
    `a transfer of funds under the funds transfer regulation` IS FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 3(1) the transaction is an occasional transaction` `reg 3(1) test case: a transaction outside a business relationship` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 3(1) the transaction is an occasional transaction` `reg 3(1) test case: a transaction within a business relationship` EQUALS JUST FALSE


