#ASSERT `reg 6(4)(a) the individual is regarded as entitled to the interest or having control over the trust` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 6(4)(a) the individual is regarded as entitled to the interest or having control over the trust` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `reg 6(4)(a) the individual is regarded as entitled to the interest or having control over the trust` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

-- reg 6(5): "specified interest" means a vested interest which is in possession or in remainder or reversion (or in Scotland, in fee), and defeasible or indefeasible.
