#ASSERT `reg 6(6) the person is a beneficial owner of the estate` `England and Wales` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 6(6) the person is a beneficial owner of the estate` `Northern Ireland` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 6(6) the person is a beneficial owner of the estate` `Northern Ireland` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 6(6) the person is a beneficial owner of the estate` `Scotland` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 6(6) the person is a beneficial owner of the estate` `Scotland` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 6(6) the person is a beneficial owner of the estate` `Scotland` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- reg 6(7): a legal entity or arrangement outside regulation 5 and paragraphs (1), (3) and (6).
#ASSERT `reg 6(7) the person is a beneficial owner of the legal entity or arrangement` `an individual who benefits from the property of the entity or arrangement` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 6(7) the person is a beneficial owner of the legal entity or arrangement` `a member of the class of persons in whose main interest the entity or arrangement is set up or operates` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
