#ASSERT `reg 6(9) the individual is a beneficial owner in any other case` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 6(9) the individual is a beneficial owner in any other case` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- reg 6(7) with reg 6(9): where both say yes, or reg 6(9) says yes, yes; where only reg 6(7) says yes, the text does not choose; where both say no, no.
