#ASSERT `reg 6(7) and (9) the individual is a beneficial owner of an entity outside regulation 5 and regulation 6(1), (3) and (6)` (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 6(7) and (9) the individual is a beneficial owner of an entity outside regulation 5 and regulation 6(1), (3) and (6)` NOTHING (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `reg 6(7) and (9) the individual is a beneficial owner of an entity outside regulation 5 and regulation 6(1), (3) and (6)` (JUST TRUE) NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `reg 6(7) and (9) the individual is a beneficial owner of an entity outside regulation 5 and regulation 6(1), (3) and (6)` NOTHING (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE

§ `Tests: reg 7, supervisory authorities`

-- Fixtures.  Each is a relevant person described by the facts reg 7(1) sorts on; every flag not named is FALSE and every list not named is empty.
GIVEN kinds IS A LIST OF `Kind of relevant person`
      authorised IS A BOOLEAN
      msb IS A BOOLEAN
      excluded IS A BOOLEAN
      annex1 IS A BOOLEAN
      emi IS A BOOLEAN
      cuni IS A BOOLEAN
      rie IS A BOOLEAN
      bill IS A BOOLEAN
      telecom IS A BOOLEAN
      bodies IS A LIST OF `Professional body`
GIVETH A `reg 7 Facts about the relevant person`
`reg 7 test case: facts` MEANS
    `reg 7 Facts about the relevant person` WITH
        `kinds of relevant person` IS kinds
        `an authorised person` IS authorised
        `a money service business` IS msb
        `an excluded money service business` IS excluded
        `an Annex 1 financial institution` IS annex1
        `an electronic money institution` IS emi
        `a credit union in Northern Ireland` IS cuni
        `a recognised investment exchange within the meaning of section 285 of FSMA` IS rie
        `a bill payment service provider` IS bill
        `a telecommunication, digital and IT payment service provider` IS telecom
        `professional bodies of which it is a member, or by which it is regulated or supervised` IS bodies

